{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"九年春，天子使南季來聘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"三月癸酉，大雨，震電。庚辰，大雨雪。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"挾卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"夏，城郎。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"秋七月。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"冬，公會齊侯于防。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"九年春，王三月癸酉，大雨霖以震，書始也。庚辰，大雨雪，亦如之。書，時失也。凡雨，自三日以往為霖。平地尺為大雪。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"夏，城郎，書，不時也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"宋公不王。鄭伯為王左卿士，以王命討之，伐宋。宋以入郛之役怨公，不告命。公怒，絕宋使。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"秋，鄭人以王命來告伐宋。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"冬，公會齊侯于防，謀伐宋也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"北戎侵鄭，鄭伯禦之。患戎師，曰；「彼徒我車，懼其侵軼我也。」公子突曰：「使勇而無剛者，嘗寇而速去之。君為三覆以待之。戎輕而不整，貪而無親，勝不相讓，敗不相救。先者見獲必務進，進而遇覆必速奔，後者不救，則無繼矣。乃可以逞。」從之。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_ttr_9_15","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_9","textTraditional":"戎人之前遇覆者奔，祝聃逐之。衷戎師，前後擊之，盡殪。戎師大奔。十一月甲寅，鄭人大敗戎師。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}